  "summary": "I am a Software Developer here at GCC – one of the fastest-growing internet retailers and part of The Home Depot’s industry-leading family brands.\n\nAs one of our core values, I am always striving to continuously improve while bringing 100% effort to all that I do. I thrive in rapidly growing, innovative organizations and I am passionate about making things seamless for internal and external customers. \n\nBefore GCC, I worked within two high-volume customer service centers, my responsibilities included managing company initiatives and leading teams to their highest potential. \n\nOutside of the office, I enjoy watching Sci-Fi movies on Netflix and playing with my dog Ninja Oreo (she is a ninja quick at taking my shoes, hence her name). I also have a passion for finding trends with data and I like to code for fun!",
